      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-22T16:24:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was just looking at the art for Inspiring Supertonic again. It shows Mr. Fixer punching a figure that looks like Baron Blade (with a green energy ball from Argent Adept's power), but the Baron Blade appears to be a mechanical golem:</p><ul>\n<li>BB's head is coming off, which sounds fatal, but we know (eg from the Tactics Kickstarter) that BB continues around.</li>\n<li>There appear to be some wires dangling from the head, and other metal bits.</li>\n</ul><p>Any thoughts on what's going on? The flavor text is from \"Burying the Blade #5\".</p><p>Hmm, maybe the Tactics BB is actually a golem himself! The Kickstarter update says that he was left a \"drained and broken man\", but the image there sure doesn't look like it. But note the BB that Mr. Fixer is punching doesn't have the tech gauntlet yet.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
